<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Sshfs on Svtter's Blog</title><link>https://svtter.cn/tags/sshfs/</link><description>Recent content in Sshfs on Svtter's Blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 13 Mar 2025 16:04:12 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://svtter.cn/tags/sshfs/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Using Sshfs to Mount Remote Folder.md</title><link>https://svtter.cn/p/using-sshfs-to-mount-remote-folder.md/</link><pubDate>Thu, 13 Mar 2025 16:04:12 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://svtter.cn/p/using-sshfs-to-mount-remote-folder.md/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;因为操作远程目录不是很容易，我之前一直倾向于采用 nfs 来挂载磁盘。但是 nfs 磁盘配置起来并不简单，涉及到权限等一系列问题。&lt;/p&gt;
